	(text "Can't add pullup on CS1 due to IO2 needing to float on boot.\nTo keep it uniform, there are no CS pullups for any of the chips.\nInstead, we pull them low in software after boot, and then issue\na reset to clear any incorrect register values."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.145 41.275 0)
